# AMBOSS - Medical Knowledge Platform


Empowering all medical professionals to provide the best possible care


## Overview


AMBOSS is a comprehensive digital medical knowledge and learning platform serving healthcare professionals worldwide. Founded in 2012 by doctors for doctors, AMBOSS supports medical students, physicians, nurses, physician assistants, medical residents, and medical educators throughout their entire careers.


-   Founded: 2012 in Germany
    
-   Mission: Empower all medical professionals to provide the best possible care
    
-   Global Reach: 2+ million healthcare professionals in 170+ countries
    
-   Institutional Partners: 800+ medical schools, hospitals, and healthcare institutions
    
-   Team: 150+ physicians, around 600 employees (AMBOSSians)
    
-   Headquarters: Berlin, Germany; New York, USA
    
-   Additional Offices: Cologne, Germany; Cagliari, Italy
    


